OL,3,GNEWSARepairs continue after water
OL,4,Arestored to homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepair work is continuing on a large
OL,7,Fburst water main near a Surrey
OL,8,Freservoir which affected supplies to as
OL,9,Fmany as 15,000 properties.
OL,11,FThames Water said running water should
OL,12,Fnow be restored to properties affected
OL,13,Fby the burst in East Molesey on Monday,
OL,14,Fwhich affected homes in Surrey and
OL,15,Fparts of south London.
OL,17,FThe water company said it was
OL,18,Fcontinuing to reroute water to keep
OL,19,Ftaps on during the repairs, and a
OL,20,Fbottled water station would be open at
OL,21,FSandown Park Racecourse until 21:00
OL,22,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
